        "original_id": "030ed40c-30f1-5d52-b345-ecb9b8320313",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leon Robinson, Jon Turteltaub, Robert Townsend, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, John Candy\n- Films: The Temptations, The Five Heartbeats, Cool Runnings, Above the Rim\n- Music Groups: Leon & The Peoples\n- Roles: David Ruffin, J.T. Matthews, Derice Bannock, Shep\n\nFacts:\n- Leon Robinson played J.T. Matthews in the 1991 Robert Townsend film The Five Heartbeats.\n- Cool Runnings is a 1993 American comedy sports film directed by Jon Turteltaub.\n- Cool Runnings stars Leon Robinson, Doug E. Doug, Rawle D. Lewis, Malik Yoba, and John Candy.\n- Leon Robinson played Derice Bannock in the 1993 film Cool Runnings.\n- Leon Robinson played Shep in the 1994 basketball drama film Above the Rim.\n- Leon Robinson played David Ruffin in the 1998 TV movie The Temptations.\n- Leon & The Peoples is a reggae-soul band led by actor and singer-songwriter Leon Robinson.\n- Leon Robinson is best known for his roles in The Temptations, The Five Heartbeats, Cool Runnings, and Above the Rim.",
